src/laya/*
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The browser runtime for Laya under src/laya/ (tokenizer, sequence construction,
post-processing and the onnxruntime-web session) is derived from

    https://github.com/nvkudva/laya-web  (app/src/laya/)
    Copyright (c) nvkudva
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

which is in turn a TypeScript port of the reference implementation

    https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
    Copyright (c) Nandakishor M / Convai Innovations
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Local modifications are limited to src/laya/session.ts: staged loading (the
tokenizer/config load separately so the UI can count tokens before the ~524 MB
of weights arrive), optional per-stage timing callbacks for the metrics panel,
the wasm thread count kept on the session instance, and a configurable weights
base URL (src/config.ts). The tokenization and sequence-construction logic
(src/laya/tokenizer.ts, src/laya/sequence.ts, src/laya/postprocess.ts) is
deliberately left byte-identical to the upstream port, because token-for-token
equality with the Python reference (verified: scripts/parity-check.ts, 26/26
cases) is what makes the probabilities comparable.

